00:00:57.580 --> 00:01:06.140
They are covering 482 municipalities in 12 states and 8,827 polling places at the request

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:11.060
of the electoral courts and with the presidency's authorization, Infobuy Reports.

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:16.420
