00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:19.520
More than 158 million people can vote.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:23.080
El Pais puts that near a 159 million.

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:30.220
Louis Inacio Lula de Silva, 80, of the Workers' Party, wants a fourth term and says it would be his last.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:36.020
Senator Flavio Bolsonaro, 45, of the Liberal Party, is the main challenger.

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:40.560
Info by Count Lula, Flavio Bolsonaro, and 11 others.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:44.460
