Data full has latest survey puts Lula at 42% in Bolsonaro at 38, with a 2-point margin of error.

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:56.600
L. Pais had lined a last poll at 45 percent to 42.

00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:02.040
The survey's info by-sites do not put either man at the 50 percent needed to win today.

